      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MR MARRAKECH (2) is heading the right way with his form this season, and was runner-up in a 4-horse field here nearly 4 weeks ago. He has won 2 of his 3 starts third up in the past, and is nicely poised to go on better in this. IF I WAS YOU (4) did not fire in a tougher field here nearly 3 weeks ago, and is probably better over 1300m at this stage of his prep. He has the pole position, and can make amends. TIME TO BACA (5) has a good record here over this trip, and with a handy 3kg claim, she is well placed to figure in the top 3 this time. BRAZEN BON (3) has not won for some time, but has been racing as consistently as ever. He is likely to settle back, but can finish all over the top of them here. Stick with him. GALAXY GENERAL (1) absolutely bolted in at Katherine last time out, and there is no reason why he can't reproduce that performance on this circuit. Go again.",
